{"id":"ru-5f4ed9870399.en","jokeId":"ru-5f4ed9870399","locale":"en","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Russian 'почистить' covers both cleaning and emptying; rebuilt on 'cleaned it out', which the husband hears as cleaning while she means his pockets.","title":"Cleaned Out","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Honey, did you clean my jacket?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Cleaned it out, dear.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"And my trousers?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Cleaned them out too.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"And my shoes?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"zhena","text":"Why, do they have pockets too?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-5f4ed9870399.de","jokeId":"ru-5f4ed9870399","locale":"de","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Rebuilt on 'gereinigt' vs 'ausgeräumt': she answers that she emptied the clothes, he asks about shoes with 'geputzt', she asks if they have pockets.","title":"Gründlich ausgeräumt","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Schatz, hast du mein Sakko gereinigt?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ja, Liebling. Gründlich ausgeräumt.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Und die Hose?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Natürlich, Liebling. Auch ausgeräumt.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Und die Schuhe, hast du die geputzt?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"zhena","text":"Wieso, haben die etwa auch Taschen?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-e4f1302c8d71.ru","jokeId":"ru-e4f1302c8d71","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Short dialogue kept as is; the challenger is a fellow officer.","title":"Дуэль","location":"bar","cast":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"officer","sluzhivy":"rzhevsky"},"lines":[{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Поручик, вы трус и подлец!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Я вызываю вас на дуэль!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Я не приду.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Почему?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Потому что я трус и подлец.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-e4f1302c8d71.en","jokeId":"ru-e4f1302c8d71","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Generic lieutenant; the joke needs no Rzhevsky background.","title":"The Duel","location":"bar","cast":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"officer","sluzhivy":"rzhevsky"},"lines":[{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Lieutenant, you are a coward and a scoundrel!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"I challenge you to a duel!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"I won't come.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Why not?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Because I'm a coward and a scoundrel.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-e4f1302c8d71.de","jokeId":"ru-e4f1302c8d71","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Generic Leutnant; formal Sie fits the duel register.","title":"Das Duell","location":"bar","cast":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"officer","sluzhivy":"rzhevsky"},"lines":[{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Herr Leutnant, Sie sind ein Feigling und ein Schuft!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Ich fordere Sie zum Duell!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Ich komme nicht.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Warum nicht?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Weil ich ein Feigling und ein Schuft bin.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-4db686de9de9.ru","jokeId":"ru-4db686de9de9","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Narration replaced by the husband saying he has little time left; the husband is not named, the rival stays Джо as in the source.","title":"Последняя просьба","location":"spalnya","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"husband"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Дорогая, мне осталось недолго.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Выполнишь мою последнюю просьбу?","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Конечно, дорогой.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Через полгода после моей смерти выходи замуж за Джо.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Но ты же его ненавидишь!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ещё как ненавижу.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-4db686de9de9.en","jokeId":"ru-4db686de9de9","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Husband takes the puppet name Joe, so the rival (Joe in the source) is renamed Frank to avoid a clash.","title":"Last Wish","location":"spalnya","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"husband"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Darling, I don't have long.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Will you grant my last wish?","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Of course, Joe.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Six months after I'm gone, I want you to marry Frank.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"But I thought you hated him!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Oh, I do.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-4db686de9de9.de","jokeId":"ru-4db686de9de9","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Husband takes the puppet name Horst; the rival is localised as Klaus.","title":"Der letzte Wunsch","location":"spalnya","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"husband"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Schatz, ich habe nicht mehr lange.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Erfüllst du mir einen letzten Wunsch?","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Natürlich, Horst.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ein halbes Jahr nach meinem Tod heiratest du Klaus.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Aber ich dachte, du hasst ihn!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Und wie ich ihn hasse.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-f86f09f02cc6.ru","jokeId":"ru-f86f09f02cc6","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Two men: the friend is played by the muzhik-sosed double and walks up for the meeting.","title":"Прошлое лето","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Здорово! Сколько лет, сколько зим!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik-sosed"]},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Пойдём, отметим встречу!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Не, я завязал.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Почему?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Помнишь прошлое лето?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Ну, помню.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А я нет.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-f86f09f02cc6.en","jokeId":"ru-f86f09f02cc6","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Two men: the friend is played by the muzhik-sosed double and walks up for the meeting.","title":"Last Summer","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Hey! Long time no see!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik-sosed"]},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Come on, this calls for a drink!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Nah, I quit drinking.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"What? Why?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Remember last summer?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Sure.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Well, I don't.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-f86f09f02cc6.de","jokeId":"ru-f86f09f02cc6","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Two men: the friend is played by the muzhik-sosed double and walks up for the meeting.","title":"Letzter Sommer","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Hey! Lange nicht gesehen!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik-sosed"]},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Komm, darauf trinken wir einen!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Nee, ich trinke nicht mehr.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Was? Warum?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Erinnerst du dich an letzten Sommer?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Klar.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich mich nicht.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-fda5e1185c48.ru","jokeId":"ru-fda5e1185c48","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"The child is a little girl, so devochka plays her instead of the suggested vovochka; the profane punchline is softened to 'без разницы' for Shorts.","title":"Кролик","location":"magazin","cast":["devochka","barmen"],"roles":{"devochka":"child","barmen":"salesman"},"lines":[{"character":"devochka","text":"Здравствуйте! Я хочу купить кролика.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["devochka"]},{"character":"barmen","text":"Какого, солнышко?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Вот этого маленького серенького, с огромными грустными глазками?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Или вот этого пушистого ленивого беленького?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"devochka","text":"А моему удаву без разницы.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-fda5e1185c48.en","jokeId":"ru-fda5e1185c48","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"The child is a little girl, so devochka plays her; profanity softened to 'couldn't care less', boa turned into a python for clarity.","title":"The Bunny","location":"magazin","cast":["devochka","barmen"],"roles":{"devochka":"child","barmen":"salesman"},"lines":[{"character":"devochka","text":"Hi! I'd like to buy a bunny.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["devochka"]},{"character":"barmen","text":"Which one, sweetie?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"This little grey one with the big sad eyes?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Or this fluffy, lazy white one?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"devochka","text":"My python couldn't care less.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-fda5e1185c48.de","jokeId":"ru-fda5e1185c48","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"The child is a little girl, so devochka plays her; profanity softened to 'völlig egal'.","title":"Das Kaninchen","location":"magazin","cast":["devochka","barmen"],"roles":{"devochka":"child","barmen":"salesman"},"lines":[{"character":"devochka","text":"Hallo! Ich möchte ein Kaninchen kaufen.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["devochka"]},{"character":"barmen","text":"Welches denn, Kleine?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Dieses kleine graue mit den großen traurigen Augen?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Oder dieses flauschige, faule weiße?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"devochka","text":"Meiner Boa ist das völlig egal.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-0431f73acccd.ru","jokeId":"ru-0431f73acccd","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"The guest walks in as the waiter greets him; order split into two short lines.","title":"На ваш вкус","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","barmen":"waiter"},"lines":[{"character":"barmen","text":"Добрый вечер! Что будем заказывать?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik"]},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Графинчик водочки.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"И что-нибудь на ваш вкус.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"barmen","text":"Так и запишем. Два графинчика водочки.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-0431f73acccd.en","jokeId":"ru-0431f73acccd","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'На ваш вкус' rendered as 'something you'd pick for yourself' so the waiter's own taste is clearly the setup.","title":"Chef's Choice","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","barmen":"waiter"},"lines":[{"character":"barmen","text":"Good evening, sir. What can I get you?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik"]},{"character":"muzhik","text":"A carafe of vodka.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"And something you'd pick for yourself.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"barmen","text":"Very good. Two carafes of vodka.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-0431f73acccd.de","jokeId":"ru-0431f73acccd","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Direct translation; the guest walks in as the waiter greets him.","title":"Nach Ihrem Geschmack","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","barmen":"waiter"},"lines":[{"character":"barmen","text":"Guten Abend! Was darf es sein?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik"]},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Eine Karaffe Wodka.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Und dazu etwas nach Ihrem Geschmack.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"barmen","text":"Sehr wohl. Also zwei Karaffen Wodka.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-e39938a189b5.ru","jokeId":"ru-e39938a189b5","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Dedication and fainting dropped; one narrator line sets the scene, the firefighter walks in to report, the head doctor delivers the punchline.","title":"Пострадавшие","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Пожарные только что потушили пожар в больнице.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Товарищ главврач, задача выполнена. Возгорание ликвидировано.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy"]},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Правда, есть пострадавшие. Девять человек.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Семерых мы откачали.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"А двоих, к сожалению, спасти не удалось.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"doktor","text":"Как семерых?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"doktor","text":"Ребята, вы же морг тушили!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-e39938a189b5.en","jokeId":"ru-e39938a189b5","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Dedication and fainting dropped; one narrator line sets the scene, the firefighter walks in to report, the head doctor delivers the punchline.","title":"Casualties","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Firefighters have just put out a fire at the hospital.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Mission accomplished, Doctor. The fire is out.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy"]},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"We did have some casualties, though. Nine people.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"We managed to revive seven.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Sadly, we lost the other two.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"doktor","text":"You revived seven?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"doktor","text":"Guys, the fire was in the morgue!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"ru-e39938a189b5.de","jokeId":"ru-e39938a189b5","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Dedication and fainting dropped; one narrator line sets the scene, the firefighter walks in to report, the head doctor delivers the punchline.","title":"Die Opfer","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"firefighter","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Die Feuerwehr hat gerade einen Brand im Krankenhaus gelöscht.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Herr Doktor, Einsatz erfolgreich. Das Feuer ist aus.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["sluzhivy-ryadovoy"]},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Leider gab es Opfer. Neun Personen.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Sieben konnten wir wiederbeleben.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Zwei haben es leider nicht geschafft.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"doktor","text":"Sieben wiederbelebt?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"doktor","text":"Leute, es hat doch in der Leichenhalle gebrannt!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
